  "phase3_gemini_self_healing": {
    "forensics": "The losing cluster is driven by three primary failure modes: high-beta morning chop (10:15\u201311:05 IST) triggering tight 0.45% stop-losses (TATASTEEL, ITC, NTPC), late-afternoon entries (after 14:20 IST) running out of intraday momentum and succumbing to EOD square-off fee drag (COALINDIA, ICICIBANK), and premature breakeven stop triggers (1.0R) turning profitable excursions into net-loss trades after brokerage and STT (AXISBANK Trade #8). Notably, Phase 2 generated a positive gross P&L (+\u20b912.95) that was flipped to a \u20b9-37.33 net loss entirely by \u20b950.28 in transaction costs.",
    "learning": "In small-capital NSE cash equity trading, transaction costs (STT, exchange turnover, GST) create a structural hurdle of ~0.15% round-trip; therefore, liquidity sweep setups require higher volume conviction (2.4x+) to avoid mid-morning retail stop-hunts, slightly wider stops (0.55%) to survive 5-minute bar noise on high-beta counters, and delayed breakeven triggers (1.25R) so trailed stops clear the fee threshold.",
    "parameter_patch": {
      "min_target_pct": 1.35,
      "min_sweep_vol_multiplier": 2.4,
      "breakeven_trigger_r": 1.25,
      "min_sl_pct": 0.55
    },
    "plan_update_summary": "### Cycle #99 Post-Mortem & Parameter Mutation\nForensic analysis of Cycle #99 revealed that while the DeepSeek V4.1 Flash filter achieved a positive gross expectancy (+\u20b912.95 across 14 trades), net performance (\u20b9-37.33, PF 0.69) was eroded by \u20b950.28 in statutory fees, morning whipsaws between 10:15\u201311:05 IST, and stagnant post-14:20 IST entries hitting EOD square-off. To eliminate low-conviction retail noise and overcome fee drag, `min_sweep_vol_multiplier` is raised from 2.0x to 2.4x to demand true institutional order-flow footprints. Furthermore, `min_sl_pct` is widened from 0.45% to 0.55% to prevent premature stop-outs on volatile tickers like TATASTEEL, while `breakeven_trigger_r` is pushed from 1.0R to 1.25R alongside a `min_target_pct` increase to 1.35% to ensure trailed stops and profit targets comfortably clear NSE cash transaction costs."
